{"uuid":"fcb830e5-85ff-48f3-be1e-46e102a5c8e8","variant":"base","mode":"judged","verdict":"fail","notes":"as=player, desktop and mobile (D21 sample). The optional discard, the Discover bound (2● discarded: only the 3● and 5● deck characters offered, the 2● and nine 1● characters excluded), reload between the discard and the offer (same prompt id and candidates, discard uncommitted), resolution, board, and log lines all pass with empty __caps. Fail: the auto-answered discard's notice (\"... had only one possible card, so it was chosen automatically\") appears while the two-card Discover offer is open, so it reads as describing the offer, and on mobile it covers the picker's Submit button (elementFromPoint at its centre hits the notice). Cause outside this bead's areas: the autoAnswered notice copy names only the prompt kind, not its role (src/runtime/battle-prompt-messages.ts engineBattleNoticeCopy), and the notice overlays the card picker's controls (suspected src/cumulus/screens/MobileBattleScreen.tsx notice placement). Fix bead: hv-umm2.362 (auto-answer notice names its purpose and clears before the next prompt), which re-judges this entity.","bead":"hv-umm2.67","commit":"ebeecef8dd46162a76c7f1375f790c57925221b9","screens":["scrap-optional-desktop.png","scrap-optional-mobile.png","scrap-offer-desktop.png","scrap-offer-mobile.png","scrap-settled-desktop.png","scrap-settled-mobile.png","scrap-log-desktop.png","scrap-log-mobile.png"]}
{"uuid":"fcb830e5-85ff-48f3-be1e-46e102a5c8e8","variant":"base","mode":"judged","verdict":"pass","notes":"as=enemy, desktop and mobile: with an empty enemy hand the trigger resolves and does nothing; with a 2● card staged in the enemy hand the AI discards it into its public void, the log reads it in plain language, no character in its deck costs more so nothing is discovered and no deck card is named, the enemy hand stays face down, and __caps is empty.","bead":"hv-umm2.67","commit":"ebeecef8dd46162a76c7f1375f790c57925221b9","screens":["scrap-enemy-start-desktop.png","scrap-enemy-start-mobile.png","scrap-enemy-settled-desktop.png","scrap-enemy-settled-mobile.png","scrap-enemy-log-desktop.png","scrap-enemy-log-mobile.png","scrap-enemy-discard-settled-desktop.png","scrap-enemy-discard-settled-mobile.png","scrap-enemy-discard-log-desktop.png","scrap-enemy-discard-log-mobile.png"]}
